  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;２．平野満氏、中嶋勝規氏、中山隆一郎氏、岸田梨江氏は、社外監査役であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row3Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３．2023年10月26日開催の定時株主総会の終結の時から１年間&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row4Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;４．2020年10月29日開催の定時株主総会の終結の時から４年間&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
