&lt;td colspan="10" style="vertical-align:middle;background-color:#cceeff;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:7.5pt;padding-right:3.7pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;現金及び現金同等物に係る換算差額&lt;/p&gt;
